@startuml
' NewEra POS - State diagram of a rental (DR-06, DR-07), W09
' Team D - editable source of assets/state_rental.png
' Render with: java -jar plantuml.jar -tpng assets/state_rental.puml
' Sources: SRS UC3, UC5, DR-06, DR-07, BR-11, BR-12, BR-15, BR-16 (review #50, B-D03 and B-D19).

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam StateBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #EAF1FB
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B8A04A
skinparam StateStartColor #444444
skinparam StateEndColor #444444

title NewEra POS - State diagram: life of a rental

state "Being created" as Creating
state "Open" as Open
state "Overdue" as Overdue
state "Return in progress" as Returning
state "Closed" as Closed
state "Closed, refund pending" as Pending

[*] --> Creating : makeNewRental()\n(UC3 steps 2-3)
Creating --> [*] : cancelled before payment (FR-36),\nnot paid, or crash:\nnothing is saved
Creating --> Open : payment accepted\n(UC3 step 15, FR-38)

Open --> Overdue : the due date has passed\n(calculated, not stored, DR-06)
Open --> Returning : makeNewRentalReturn()\n(UC5 steps 2-5)
Overdue --> Returning : makeNewRentalReturn()\n(UC5 steps 2-5)
Returning --> Open : cancelled (UC5 ext. 8a, FR-56)\nor crash: the rental stays as it was
Returning --> Closed : rental return confirmed and\nrefund paid or card refund made\n(UC5 steps 9-10, FR-57)
Returning --> Pending : confirmed, but the Payment Service\ngives no answer and the refund status\nis not known (UC5 ext. 9b2b)
Pending --> Closed : a store manager completes the refund
Closed --> [*]

note right of Open
  A rental lasts 1, 3 or 7 days (BR-15).
  A customer with an Overdue rental cannot
  start a new rental (BR-12).
end note

note bottom of Overdue
  Late fee: one day's rental fee for each whole day late (BR-16).
  It is taken from the deposit; the Customer pays the rest
  (UC5 ext. 7a, 7b).
end note

note bottom of Pending
  The item status changes at the confirmation: Available or Under maintenance
  (see the state diagram of the item status).
  The refund is never paid twice. The function with which the
  store manager completes the refund has no FR yet.
end note
@enduml
